  "overview": "**ONS Design System** is a light-first design system anchored on `#ffffff` canvas surfaces with `#0b0b0c` primary ink (19.7:1 contrast) and `#e2b500` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `OpenSans` (24px display down to 14px body), unified by `0px` razor-sharp architectural corners and subtle shadow elevation.\n\nMaintained by **Office for National Statistics**. Source: published token package, package `@ons/design-system`. Inventory: **90** colors, **7** typography steps, and **30** documented components (MIT license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 30 component tokens with documented paddings: `0`, `.875rem 1rem`, `.5rem 0`, `.75rem 1rem`, `.8rem 0`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#f2f2f2` cards; separate sibling sections using `#cccccc` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Layered Shadow Model**: Uses documented shadows (`0 0.1875rem 0 #073d20`, `0 -2px #fbc900,0 4px #222`) paired with `#cccccc` borders for elevated overlays.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#e2b500` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#ffffff` (light) with `#0b0b0c` primary text and `#0b0b0c` secondary labels.\n- Use `#e2b500` with `#0b0b0c` text (10.2:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `OpenSans` headings with `OpenSans` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Enforce `0px` border-radius consistently across cards, inputs, and primary buttons.\n- Separate containers via `#f2f2f2` surface shifts and `#cccccc` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not apply rounded corners (> 0px) to structural containers or CTA buttons.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `input-type` fields and secondary buttons."
}
